## Common patterns (seeded from prior projects)

- `tests/**.py with threading + setUpClass` — small local models often produce invalid Python here. Route to `codex` or `opus`.
- `.js with canvas/DOM API` — small local models often write code that crashes at runtime (e.g., `document.canvas.width`). Route to `opus`.
- Codex with `--sandbox workspace-write` will sometimes modify files outside the target — verify with a post-run lane check.

